    {
      "source": "<a href=\"PropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a> that reads keys and values from a <code>Map</code> object.\nThe underlying map should not contain any <code>null</code> values in order to\ncomply with <a href=\"#getProperty(java.lang.String)\"><code>getProperty(String)</code></a> and <a href=\"#containsProperty(java.lang.String)\"><code>containsProperty(String)</code></a> semantics.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"PropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a> 用于从 <code>Map</code> 对象读取键和值。底层映射不应包含任何 <code>null</code> 值，以符合 <a href=\"#getProperty(java.lang.String)\"><code>getProperty(String)</code></a> 和 <a href=\"#containsProperty(java.lang.String)\"><code>containsProperty(String)</code></a> 的语义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>MapPropertySource</code> with the given name and <code>Map</code>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的带有给定名称和<code>Map</code>的<code>MapPropertySource</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
